runk, then that which is worse: but you have kept the good wine until now.", "words": [[0, 59709], [4, 59844], [9, 60064], [12, 60304], [17, 61338], [23, 61596], [27, 61876], [30, 62016], [34, 62096], [44, 62376], [49, 62696], [53, 62936], [59, 63176], [64, 63396], [70, 64109], [74, 64245], [79, 64365], [83, 64585], [88, 64765], [93, 64925], [100, 65465], [105, 65705], [110, 65925], [116, 66105], [119, 66265], [126, 67038], [130, 67196], [134, 67376], [139, 67536], [144, 67756], [148, 67916], [153, 68076], [158, 68316], [164, 68696]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 69532, "end": 77743, "text": "This beginning of miracles did Jesus in Cana of Galilee, and manifested forth his glory; and his disciples believed on him.", "words": [[0, 69532], [5, 69731], [15, 70131], [18, 70351], [27, 70831], [31, 71171], [37, 71651], [40, 72051], [45, 72451], [48, 72551], [57, 73151], [61, 73511], [72, 74051], [78, 74551], [82, 74791], [89, 75744], [93, 75849], [97, 75989], [107, 76489], [116, 76949], [119, 77309]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 78193, "end": 86816, "text": "¶ After this he went down to Capernaum, he, and his mother, and his brethren, and his disciples: and they continued there not many days.", "words": [[2, 78193], [8, 78433], [13, 78753], [16, 78993], [21, 79213], [26, 79533], [29, 79753], [40, 80673], [44, 80893], [48, 81193], [52, 81353], [60, 81653], [64, 82233], [68, 82393], [78, 82753], [82, 83133], [86, 83273], [97, 84430], [101, 84553], [106, 84673], [116, 85173], [122, 85473], [126, 85773], [131, 86133]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 87266, "end": 91742, "text": "¶ And the Jews’ passover was at hand, and Jesus went up to Jerusalem,", "words": [[2, 87266], [6, 87407], [10, 87487], [16, 87967], [25, 88447], [29, 88727], [32, 88867], [38, 89607], [42, 89827], [48, 90187], [53, 90527], [56, 90687], [59, 90867]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 92192, "end": 98289, "text": "And found in the temple those that sold oxen and sheep and doves, and the changers of money sitting:", "words": [[0,